            >"The Two Reacts"</a
          >, the essay form of the thesis:
          <strong>UI is a function of data <em>and</em> state</strong>, and no single computer can
          evaluate that function alone. The best deep reading on
          <em>why</em> the split exists.
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>May 2024</strong>: React Conf 2024</td>
        <td>
          <a
